Package: a3-desk
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: A3 Desk, the A3 Mixer on a screen
 The virtual desk of the A3 system: the A3 Mixer's layout on any machine of
 the A3 network -- a second operator, or a stand-in for the hardware desk.
 It sends what the hardware sends and shows what A3 Core reports; Core
 follows up to four. Opened by hand (a3-desk); no service.
